────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
A NOTE ON WHAT THIS LICENSE CAN AND CANNOT DO
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This license is a legal instrument, not a technical one. It gives
qFoldIT legal standing to act against unauthorized copying or
redistribution after the fact — it does not, and cannot, technically
prevent someone from viewing this page's source, saving it, or copying
it, since it is served as plain HTML/CSS/JS from a public URL
(`qfoldit.github.io/web-toolbelt/`) to any browser that requests it.
Restricting *technical* access (rather than the *legal* right to reuse)
would require moving this content behind authentication, off of public
GitHub Pages hosting — a materially different, and materially more
disruptive, change than adding this license file. This license was
chosen deliberately understanding that trade-off, not in place of it.
